diff --git a/changelog.md b/changelog.md
index 3e5bed2..4e299a5 100644
--- a/changelog.md
+++ b/changelog.md
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@
     * JobGroup
     * FullName
   * Triggers can no longer be constructed with a **null** group name (#1359)
+  * **TaskSchedulingThreadPool.GetDefaultScheduler()** now takes a **CancellationToken** that is cancelled when the thread pool is shut down, allowing schedulers that own threads (such as the one used by **DedicatedThreadPool**) to stop them; previously these threads leaked after shutdown
   * The *endUtc* argument of **SimpleTriggerImpl** is no longer nullable.
   * If a value is explicitly specified for "IdleWaitTime", we will no longer silently ignore the value (and use
     a default value of 30 seconds instead) if it's less than or equal to **zero**.
